WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.090 --> 00:00:07.010
Britain’s iconic red squirrel is in trouble.
The problem: The invasive Eastern grey squirrel,

00:00:07.010 --> 00:00:10.790
brought to England from North American about
140 years ago.

00:00:10.790 --> 00:00:15.050
Wealthy collectors in the 19th century
liked to keep gray squirrels as pets

00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:19.010
or release them onto their estates
as kind of a living lawn ornament.

00:00:19.010 --> 00:00:23.750
In fact, there's genetic evidence that all of the
gray squirrels in Ireland

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:27.180
are descended from 6 pairs sent as a wedding gift.

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:30.520
The gray squirrel is bad news for the native red squirrels

00:00:30.520 --> 00:00:34.720
because they out-compete them for food and habitat. Worst of all,

00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:41.040
grays carry a virus called squirrelpox. It doesn’t harm
the gray squirrels, or people for that matter,

00:00:41.050 --> 00:00:46.660
but it is deadly to the reds. The many conservation groups are working to save the red squirrel

00:00:46.660 --> 00:00:51.059
have had some successes. Gray squirrels
have been eradicated from the Isle of Anglesey.

00:00:51.059 --> 00:00:57.059
It took 18 years, but now the
island’s red squirrels are on the rebound.

00:00:57.059 --> 00:01:02.449
There is hope that nature may help. The pine
marten, a relative of weasels, is a native

00:01:02.449 --> 00:01:06.350
predator. Scientists in Ireland
 have noticed an intriguing pattern:

00:01:06.359 --> 00:01:11.859
where pine martens show up, the population
of gray squirrels declines and red squirrels

00:01:11.860 --> 00:01:15.859
start to recover.
It may be that red squirrels, which evolved with the pine marten,

00:01:15.859 --> 00:01:22.479
are better able to escape these tree climbing predators. The future of the red squirrel is looking

00:01:22.479 --> 00:01:26.179
brighter in the U.K. there's still much to be done.

00:01:26.179 --> 00:01:31.369
The lesson for other countries is to prevent
gray squirrels from arriving at all, or getting

00:01:31.369 --> 00:01:40.849
rid of them as quickly as possible, and to definitely
not give them as wedding presents.

